"[{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":43,\"ReplacementContent\":\"- **Restructured Sidebar Layout with Core Signals**:\\n  - Structured the left sidebar to explicitly guide the user through four primary signals: **Who I Am**, **Availability**, **What I Do**, and **Why Hire Me**.\\n  - **Typographic Section Dividers**: Added stylized section dividers (`01. WHAT I DO` and `02. WHY HIRE ME`) styled in small uppercase `Geist Mono` characters with a thin divider line and a colored number prefix matching the brand's HSL accent.\\n  - **Restructured Section Flow**: Placed the interactive Focus Deck (`WHAT I DO`) directly under the presence widget to immediately showcase active domain expertise. Placed the credentials cards (`WHY HIRE ME`) below the Focus Deck to back up these capabilities with tangible qualifications.\\n- **Unified Credentials Cards with Outcome-Focused Copy**:\\n  - Re-copywritten credentials card headings to speak directly as value outcomes to recruiters and clients:\\n    - **Experience Card**: Upgraded from \\\"UX Across Complex Industries\\\" to **\\\"Simplifying Complex Systems\\\"** (signaling technical UX depth).\\n    - **MBA Branding Card**: Upgraded from \\\"Brand & Design Alignment\\\" to **\\\"Aligning Design & Business ROI\\\"** (signaling strategic business focus).\\n  - Each card combines a visual metric badge on the left (`3+ Yrs`, `MBA`) and its corresponding scannable tags on the right.\\n  - Hovering a card triggers HSL-themed border highlights and glows (Orange for Experience, Pink for MBA Branding).\\n- **Direct Right-Pane Project Glow Coupling**:\\n  - Hovering or focusing a unified credentials card highlights the matching case study cards in the right pane with a purple pulse glow (`.flash-highlight`), establishing an immediate connection:\\n    - **Experience**: Highlights all projects (*Yooki, Aura AI, Cendrol*).\\n    - **MBA Branding**: Highlights *Yooki* and *Aura AI*.\\n- **Staggered Visual Intro Showcase (On Load)**:\\n  - 900ms after load, a staggered sequence sequentially highlights each of the two unified c\n<truncated 3182 bytes>"